itments & Constraints\n- **Mandatory Rules ([`REGLA_SIN_ABRIR_TORNILLOS_NO_TTL.md`](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/.agents/rules/REGLA_SIN_ABRIR_TORNILLOS_NO_TTL.md)):**\n  1. **100% External (Zero screws opened, Zero UART TTL).**\n  2. **Never mention or ask the user to click `Compilación` 7 times.**\n  3. **Never flash `factory.img` (Widevine L1) or `cri_data.img` (MAC/Serial).**\n- **Language:** Always respond in Spanish with clickable markdown links.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 7 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1793597714664_620af5e3]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/andre/.gemini/antigravity/brain/5ecd42aa-1b9a-4dda-aec7-a32c9730884f/.user_uploaded/media_1793597714664_620af5e3.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-02T05:35:22Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1793597896526_d7132122]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/andre/.gemini/antigravity/brain/5ecd42aa-1b9a-4dda-aec7-a32c9730884f/.user_uploaded/media_1793597896526_d7132122.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-02T05:38:19Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1793667276182_e83ccce9]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/andre/.gemini/antigravity/brain/5ecd42aa-1b9a-4dda-aec7-a32c9730884f/.user_uploaded/media_1793667276182_e83ccce9.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-03T00:54:40Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1793668121563_c24d8107]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/andre/.gemini/antigravity/brain/5ecd42aa-1b9a-4dda-aec7-a32c9730884f/.user_uploaded/media_1793668121563_c24d8107.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-03T01:08:45Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1793669038338_d2f55238]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/andre/.gemini/antigravity/brain/5ecd42aa-1b9a-4dda-aec7-a32c9730884f/.user_uploaded/media_1793669038338_d2f55238.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-03T01:24:02Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1793770270164_40680245]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/andre/.gemini/antigravity/brain/5ecd42aa-1b9a-4dda-aec7-a32c9730884f/.user_uploaded/media_1793770270164_40680245.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-04T05:32:19Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1793771264706_95b71ed4]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/andre/.gemini/antigravity/brain/5ecd42aa-1b9a-4dda-a